[38;2;124;124;124mLet me verify the key fact: homomorphic images of divisible groups are [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mdivisible.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mIf $G$ is divisible and $\phi: G \to H$ is a surjective homomorphism, then for [0m
